  "adoption": [
    "Adopt canonical1.7.10 battery input Root min = recommended/2, fixed output and all three selector/packet mode hints; ULV changes1 to4. Existing original battery item/buffer controls remain unchanged.",
    "Adopt solar output-only source range recommended/8..recommended and FacingSingle Wrench hint; no fabricated storage or efficiency line.",
    "Adopt electric/rotational transformer normal and reversed converter ranges, deliberately high reverse input recommendation, original100percent efficiency and source Wrench/MonkeyWrench hints.",
    "Preserve the original localized face labels even in reversed mode, as Bidirectional.getLocalisedInputSide/OutputSide do. Physical reversed faces remain native existing behavior.",
    "Preserve LH fixed-output omission of range and face, converter always-range branch, raw integer values and hardcoded up to/to fragments. Unit colors follow TD/TagData: EU blue, RU green.",
    "The _w battery, solar, converter and bidirectional paths keep the same tooltip/rating structure. Canonical1.7.10 and the user Chinese patch are authority; no duplicate loader implementation imported."
  ],
